# A field written as a copy and as a constant: the result is their unification (testdata/cases/lens-duplicate).
-- source.cue --
a: int
-- target.cue --
a: int
-- lens.cue --
v0_0: _
v1_0: {a: v0_0.a, a: 1000}
-- out --
not total
v1_0.a is written as v0_0.a and as 1000, and the two unify, so one may reject the other's value; write the field once (rule write-conflict) @ lens.cue:2:8
